    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "I am Criswell! For years I have told the almost unbelievable, related the unreal, and shown it to be more... than a fact. Now I tell a tale of the threshold, people, so astounding that some of you may faint."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 245,
        "text": "Yes, they were lucky, those two young people... May you be so lucky... But do not trust to luck, at the full of the moon, when the night is dark... Make a wide path around the unholy grounds... of the Night People. Who can say that we do not exist-Can you?"
      }
    },
